yaru-theme-meta for Debian
--------------------------------

This package is a local repack of an already-generated Yaru installation
tree. It does not rebuild the themes from their original SCSS, SVG,
Meson, or other source inputs.

The package replaces Debian's split Yaru GTK, GNOME Shell, icon, and
sound packages because it installs the same canonical filesystem paths.

For a package intended for submission to Debian or broad redistribution,
use the complete upstream Yaru source and Debian's existing split-package
structure instead.

-- KnightChristopher2000
